=== PARITY (web source reproduced end-to-end) ===
  - Data sources (web useTranslation + useUnits): bound through the P1/S8 seam
    ThermalLoadSource→ThermalLoadModel. The parent (Drivetrain Health page) computes
    `sensors` (from the drivetrain-health reading), `peakPower` / `avgPowerMax` (already
    kW), and `DrivingStats`; this leaf renders that payload verbatim — no HTTP in the
    view. The `useUnits` temperature unit/locale/precision ride in the ThermalUnitContext.
  - Composition (web GlassPanel + MetricBar[] + InlineMetric[]):
      • GlassPanel  -> TSGlassPanel.
      • header      -> activity glyph (waveform.path.ecg) + muted-uppercase title
                       (web `<h3 class="… uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">`).
      • MetricBar   -> per-sensor row: label + severity-coloured temperature readout
                       (web displayTemp → formatTemperature, °C/°F, 1-dp, no space,
                       em-dash for null) over a TSMetricBar tinted by the web
                       tempSeverityColor ladder (good→success/warning→warning/critical→
                       danger/unknown→muted).
      • InlineMetric-> glyph + value + label grid (Peak Power/bolt purple · Avg Power/
                       trend cyan · Drives/activity green · Regen Ratio/shield amber),
                       with the web `peakPower>0 ? fmtInt kW : —`, `avg>0 ? fmtNumber(,1)
                       kW : —`, `stats ? fmtInt : —`, `stats ? fmtNumber(*100,1)% : —`
                       fallbacks reproduced.
  - States (ALL rendered, each a #if DEBUG preview + projection/model unit test):
      loading (parent health resolving → skeleton bars + metric row) · empty (payload
      with no sensors → friendly state, never a blank box) · error (parent failure →
      Retry) · data (bars + metric grid) · stale (freshness chip + "Reconnecting" banner
      + one-shot auto-refresh on the transition) · offline (cached payload + "Offline"
      chip/banner).
  - i18n (P1/S10): web keys preserved verbatim — drivetrain.thermalMetrics / .frontMotor
    / .rearMotor / .inverter / .battery / .peakPower / .avgPower / .drivesLabel /
    .regenRatio; native chrome namespaced thermal.* (live/stale/offline/refresh/
    staleBanner/offlineBanner/loadingA11y/empty/errorTitle/retry). Every code-referenced
    key is declared in ThermalLoadPanel.strings; NO English string literals in native
    code (all via ThermalStrings facade + Text(verbatim:)). Unit symbols (°C/°F/kW/%) are
    formatter literals, matching the AcDcStatsPanel precedent.
  - Accessibility: VoiceOver labels on the panel (title), each sensor bar (combined
    "name, temperature"), each inline metric (combined "label, value"), the freshness
    chip, refresh button, and Retry; header carries .isHeader; Dynamic-Type system fonts
    (Font.TS); reduce-motion honored (TSFadeIn / TSSkeleton).
  - Telemetry (P1/S11): ThermalLoadModel.start() emits view.opened with surface slug
    "ThermalLoadPanel" exactly once (OSLogThermalLoadTelemetry default; prod app injects
    the shared diagnostics adapter). Asserted by testStartAppliesInitialAndEmitsTelemetryOnce.

